# 构建上下文白名单：镜像只允许可运行代码、依赖声明与受管只读配置。
# 开发者 .env、outputs、profiles、浏览器 HOME、控制密钥、审计与任务文档
# 一律不得进入镜像。

.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
dist/
build/

*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

outputs/
profiles/
workspace/
workspaces/
data/
logs/
_deps/
.scratch/
.superpowers/
.claude/
.agents/

docs/superpowers/audits/
docs/superpowers/tasks/
docs/superpowers/plans/
docs/superpowers/specs/
tests/

# 补 COPY skills 后不得带入开发者私有状态/凭证/缓存。仅保留运行代码与
# 公开规则；旧公众号 YAML、token、Cookie、profile 与缓存全部排除。
skills/**/tests/
skills/**/test/
skills/**/__tests__/
skills/**/.github/
skills/**/wechat-publisher.yaml
skills/**/wechat_publisher.yaml
skills/**/cookies.json
skills/**/cookies-*.json
skills/**/*.token
skills/**/*.secret
skills/**/.cache/
skills/**/cache/
skills/**/profiles/
skills/**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.log

PSScriptAnalyzerSettings.psd1

# 本机代码索引不进入部署镜像上下文
.codegraph/
